-- Early Childhood Programs Directory: school coordinates for the nearest-school
-- search and Google Maps links. Geocoded 2026-11-03 from each street address with the
-- US Census geocoder (84 schools). Four addresses Census could not match came from
-- OpenStreetMap: Coral Park (15), Sandpiper (70), Tamarac (79), Welleby (84), the
-- last two by school name because the street address only resolved to a road.
-- All 88 fall inside Broward. The editor API geocodes new schools and address changes.
